  "answer": "You can configure CORS to allow requests from specific origins in FastAPI by using the `allow_origins` argument in the `CORSMiddleware` implementation. For example:\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\norigins = [\"https://example.org\", \"https://www.example.org\"]\n\napp.add_middleware(\n    CORSMiddleware,\n    allow_origins=origins,\n    allow_credentials=True,\n    allow_methods=[\"GET\", \"POST\"],\n    allow_headers=[\"Content-Type\", \"Authorization\"],\n)\n```\n[tutorial/cors-5]",
